<Base title="Authorized work only" description="PHP Hub only works on sites the requester owns or is authorized to manage.">
<div class="page-prose"><h1>Authorized work only</h1>
<p>We only audit, test, clean or upgrade sites that you own or are explicitly authorized to manage.</p>
<ul><li>Every request must confirm ownership or authorization. The contact form asks for this.</li>
<li>For agencies and freelancers, we may ask for written confirmation from the site owner.</li>
<li>Scope (domains, environments, what may be tested) is agreed in writing before work starts.</li>
<li>We will decline or stop work if authorization is unclear, or if a request looks like an attempt to access someone else's system.</li></ul></div></Base>
